================================
1. To Run the Database Viewer
================================
Open a new terminal window:
1. cd backend
2. npx prisma studio
(This opens the Prisma Studio at http://localhost:51212)

================================
2. To Run the Backend Server
================================
Open a new terminal window:
1. cd backend
2. npm run dev
(This starts the Express API server on http://localhost:5000)

================================
3. To Run the Frontend Website
================================
Open a new terminal window:
1. cd frontend
2. npm run dev
(This starts the React website on http://localhost:5173)
